      "id": "claim_20702ff10dca48b9a9377a0e4b27d16e",
      "statement": "The mcp-server package has three verification layers: vitest unit tests (`npm test`), a live smoke script (`npm run smoke`), and a manual flow documented in `mcp-server/TESTING.md`; plus a non-test inspection tool `npm run ingest:dump` that writes extracted text and chunk summaries to disk for manual review.",
