      "id": "claim_522f742461434e61aa381725a38571a8",
      "statement": "`mcp-server/vitest.config.ts` injects placeholder env values (`DOCS_ROOT`, `PARTIALS_ROOT`, `EXAMPLES_ROOT`, `DATA_DIR`, `OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-test`, `MCP_AUTH_TOKEN=test`) so importing `src/config.ts` (whose Zod schema hard-requires these) does not crash the test process; the fake OpenAI key is never used because the store test supplies its own embedder and `createEmbedder()` is never called.",
