      "statement": "`store.test.ts` uses a fake embedder returning deterministic orthogonal unit vectors (text i maps to the basis vector with a 1 at position i % dim), which makes top-k ordering predictable without an OpenAI API key because the vectors are mutually orthogonal and already unit-length.",
