      "id": "claim_b5e3ea19f2f1431a87b76f3a3c41e1b7",
      "statement": "`npm run ingest:dump` (`src/ingest/dump.ts`) runs the full ingest pipeline (loadAdoc, resolveMacros, renderAdoc, chunkPage) for every source file and writes, under `data/_dump/`, a `.txt` of rendered text and a `.chunks.json` summary (id, section, tokensApprox, 200-char textPreview) per page; `TESTING.md` points operators here when smoke queries fail to inspect chunk sizes and context prefixes.",
