    {
      "id": "claim_6d4a2ae8aa714f4aa5679cb9ec4f80e3",
      "statement": "The Docker image build in `.github/workflows/mcp-image.yml` runs on pushes to `mcp-integration` and `master` when `docs/**` or `mcp-server/**` change; after `npm ci` it runs `npm run typecheck` (`tsc --noEmit`) and `npm test` (`vitest run`) as gates before building and pushing the image to GHCR, so the vitest suite and type checker are the hard CI gate while the live smoke script is a developer quality bar not run in CI.",
      "evidence": [
